Hyper Beam.Description:
The target is attacked with a powerful beam.
The user takes 33% recoil
from the damage delt.(Beam)

Fury Cutter.Description:
The target is slashed with scythes or
claws. This attack doubles in power
if it hits in succession.(Slice)(C)

Focus Punch.Description:
The user focuses its mind before launching
a punch with -3 Priority. This move fails
if the user is hit before it is used.(Punch)(C)

Magma Storm.Description:
The target becomes trapped
within a maelstrom of fire that rages
for 2 to 3 turns.(Spin, Capture)
